WEBVTT

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.000
If I can break that machine...

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:37.370
This is what you wanted to do, wasn't it?

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:40.760
However, no one can stop it now.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:44.010
I've started us on a brand new course of history.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:47.590
Get out of here, Chiko!

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.480
Mister!

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:54.900
The oscillation waves will not stop until the tower is destroyed.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.720
The light will swallow all of Tokyo just like he announced.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:03.200
Get as far away as you can.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:06.300
There's still some time until the light reaches here.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.270
What about you?

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:09.260
I'm going with you.

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:12.790
Memories of me will remain with you forever.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.820
Even if this body is no more.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.940
The secret of the fourth state will be buried in the light.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:26.350
The tragedy that is about to unfold will etch itself into the memory of mankind, as an indelible darkness in their hearts.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.830
Just like that abomination of a war did.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.920
Our war will finally end here as well.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:37.130
Everyone has a darkness within their hearts.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:37.800
Chiko...

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.260
Even if they know nothing of war...

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.280
But,

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:42.530
we cannot look away.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.520
If we look firmly ahead and go forward one step at a time...

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.810
Someday, for certain,

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.600
the door will open.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:00.700
Well now, I've just about reached my goal.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.140
All that's left is to clean up the discarded remnants.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:07.510
The two of you are destined to die right here.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:12.930
Shall I kill the girl in front of you, or shall I kill you first and instill the fear of death in her?

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:14.570
Choose one.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.750
I'll go first!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.550
I expected as much.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.740
Mister!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.930
Trust in yourself, Chiko!

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:28.990
OK.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.900
Going to the roof?

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.510
What are you planning to do?

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.160
Ask Chiko.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.070
She's already flown away from me.

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:49.080
You fool!  What can a single child do?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.580
For those of us who have lost our wings, what the birds see from up in the sky is an eternal mystery.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.150
Damn you!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:04.910
Fine.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:07.240
I'll take your only hope

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:11.370
and rip it out along with the girl's feathers.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.160
They're saying it's a new type of weapon.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.080
Another war?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.950
No, it's Twenty Faces.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.610
They say it's dangerous here too.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.450
Follow orders and evacuate!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.000
There's nowhere to escape to!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:52.250
You think this is funny?!

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:57.020
It's about time.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.420
Gotcha.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.630
It's just as she said.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:35.210
Now you can't use your right arms.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.980
No matter how much your muscles have been strengthened, in the end they're based on the human body.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.980
The damage will accumulate with each blow you take.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:46.140
Looks like losing the ability to feel pain has backfired on you, eh?

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:47.990
Well then, it's about time.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.650
Could it be our turn now?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.750
What are you climbing up there for?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:59.180
Are you gonna knock over the tower with those skinny arms of yours?

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:04.760
So foolish.

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:11.430
Mister!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.390
Why won't you die already?!

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:21.020
I can pull this off.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.140
Hurry!  Run for it!

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.990
Damn it, we'll never make it in time.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.330
Akechi-san!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.860
You're going to that tower too?

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:43.840
Yes.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.000
It would be useless to try and stop you.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.090
Let's go.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.690
If I can change the direction of the oscillation waves...

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:19.290
You're thinking about using your body to stop the oscillation waves, aren't you?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.120
That's just suicide!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.700
You'll be sucked into the turbulent oscillation waves and carried down to the convergence point.

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.320
Your body will be torn to shreds.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:32.290
I'll give you a different option.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:33.340
Come with me.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:39.310
Live with me from today on as the daughter of the real Twenty Faces.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:43.310
Twenty Faces doesn't really exist.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.040
It's time for this to end,

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.610
both you and him.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:52.650
I am tearing Twenty Faces' announcement to shreds.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.220
In that case, die!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.560
Chiko...

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:34.350
You're trying to change the direction of the oscillation waves by bending the support beam?

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:36.010
What a wasted effort.

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.100
Please.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:38.990
Bend.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:49.520
For those of us who have lost our wings, what the birds see from up in the sky is an eternal mystery.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.510
Lost our wings...

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:08.310
Someday, I'd like to gather talented scientists together and build a research team.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:14.730
We will create a wonderful future with our own hands.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:18.550
We can use water to create a brand new form of energy.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.080
I'm very blessed.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.080
I'm proud that I met you all.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.090
No good...

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.940
I'm going to pass out...

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.270
Mister...

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.230
This is where we part ways.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.340
What?

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.590
The light of the ruby is disturbing the oscillation waves.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:10.850
It stopped.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.100
Impossible...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.110
Get down!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:43.840
Get back!

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.410
Damn it...  Ending up here...

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:08.810
I am to be the chosen one.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:11.480
I will seize the future with my own hands!

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.260
You...

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.720
It's fine.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:37.940
Thank you.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.940
My experiment was a success.  I'm satisfied.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.450
Just as he said...

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.620
Go and ensure the future for us.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:24.360
Boss!

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:26.360
No, it's not him.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.170
It's an artificial face.

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:35.570
This is probably the professor.

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:37.590
But why does he have the Boss's face?

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:39.840
No, never mind.  Where's Chiko?

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:40.790
Look.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:44.280
The pillar of light is gone.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.920
I see.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.980
You did it, Chiko.

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:41.150
Mister...

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:44.150
Chiko, will you come with me?

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:52.350
People will keep calling you the Daughter of Twenty Faces.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:55.290
They're going to think even worse things about you than they do now.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:15:00.070
I wish I could be with you forever.

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:01.170
But...

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:05.710
I know that you will always be a part of me.

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:14.430
I can feel each and every thing you said, like seeds that have sprouted and are beginning to grow within me.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.700
I'm not going with you.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:21.190
I will live on as the Daughter of Twenty Faces.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:26.690
And that is one step closer to the ideal you all dreamt of.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.870
I'll have children someday,

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:33.500
and both you and I will be part of them.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.100
That way, slowly but surely, in a few hundred years,

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.450
I promise our ideal future will arrive.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:43.460
It'll be a great age for mankind.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:48.020
It has to be, because you're such a wonderful person.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.220
You were all in too much of a rush.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.120
The age I was in has come to an end.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.220
It's already become your age.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.670
No.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.780
You can live a new life.  With a new name.

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.630
It is the warm law of men
C'est la chaude loi des hommes

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.210
New?

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:07.510
Shall I tell you your name?

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:08.710
It's...

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:09.480
From grapes, they make the wine
Du raisin ils font du vin
It's...

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.620
Du raisin ils font du vin

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.140
From coals, they make the fire

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.700
What do you think?  It just came to me.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:17.720
It's a great name.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:19.990
From kisses, they make the men

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:21.500
Thank you, Chiko.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.060
Des baisers ils font des hommes

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.930
It was a long night.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:33.510
Are you happy we let them die?

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.230
They were important research subjects, weren't they?

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.970
I just wanted to see them with my own eyes.

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:45.020
Weapons of death that lived all their lives on a diet of chemicals.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:49.660
The fact that it all ended here makes me happier than anyone else on Earth.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:55.700
Chiko...

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.030
Ken-niichan!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.710
It looks like it's all over.

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:03.480
Yeah.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:05.620
Where's the Boss?

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.240
He went back home,

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:09.630
to his true self.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:13.650
I see.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:18.640
This all started because of one genius scientist.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:24.900
A man who possesses twenty different faces, huh?

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.960
I said to let me inside!

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.100
No means no!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.320
Why not?!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.970
I told you that it's dangerous.

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.480
We don't know when it might collapse.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.410
I beg you!  The young lady is in there!

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:38.450
Yeah!  Are you telling me to just abandon my good friend?!

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:40.230
Koito-san...

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.610
Tome-san...

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.450
Go on, Chiko.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.120
This is farewell.

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.300
Ken-niichan...

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:52.090
I'll walk my own path.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.130
I'm sure I'll find something that keeps me excited.

00:17:56.810 --> 00:17:57.970
Take care too, OK?

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.610
Sure.

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.720
You too!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.180
Who do you think I am?

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.080
I'm the leader of the Detective Girls, Koito Shunka!

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.890
Ah!  Mikamo-san!

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:10.100
Young lady!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.150
Ah-ah-ah?

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:17.370
You had me a little worried there!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.580
Young lady!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.780
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:30.330
Thank you, Tome-san, Koito-san.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:32.790
I'm glad you're safe.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.510
What happened to Twenty Faces?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.890
He died.  Up there on the rooftop.

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.960
I see.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:45.710
The case is closed!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:48.310
Please go recover Twenty Faces' body.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:48.890
Yes, sir!

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.460
Well then.

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:02.320
I guess this means I'm my own boss from now on.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.460
Care to join me?

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:06.330
Huh?

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.830
I bet we can have a lot of fun together.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.280
That's true.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:22.430
For a while afterwards, not a day went by where the newspapers and radio didn't report on Twenty Faces.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:28.920
People made up all sorts of rumors about Twenty Faces' true identity,

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:33.190
but no one ever found out the truth about what happened.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.350
Another story has come to a close.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:42.420
But, your children will appear some day.

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:45.820
They'll scatter throughout the world and make their way here again.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:50.680
For you've got a lot more than just one face, Twenty Faces.

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:53.420
And then...

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.480
Don't cry, Koito-san.

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:00.920
It's not like we'll never see each other again.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.580
But I feel like you're saying "good riddance" to me.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:08.400
I can't do anything about it.  After all that fuss, I can't go back to school.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.350
And I've been to England before.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:14.810
Miss Shunka, I'll be right beside the young lady.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:19.960
Well, it's just so she can go somewhere where the newspaper reporters won't bother her.

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:23.450
We'll be friends no matter where we are, right?

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.950
And the Detective Girls haven't broken up either!

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:01.610
We'll meet again someday.  I know it.
